sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as CPU (M0)
    participant A1 as IP CSR (S1)
    participant A2 as DMA (M1)
    participant A3 as Memory (S0)
    participant A4 as UART
    A0->>A1: SINGLE writes: SRC=0x100, LEN=4, CTRL=1
    A1-->>A0: Each write: HREADY=1, HRESP=OKAY
    A1->>A2: START memory-to-UART
    A2->>A3: HBUSREQ; wait for granted ownership
    A2->>A3: Read INCR4: NONSEQ A0, then 3 x SEQ
    A3-->>A2: HREADY=0 inserts wait; hold current phase
    A3-->>A2: 4 accepted read data beats
    A2->>A4: Send low bytes: H, W, 1, ! (8N1)
    A4-->>A2: Final stop bit completed
    A2->>A1: DMA_DONE=1
    A0->>A1: SINGLE read STATUS
    A1-->>A0: DONE=1, BUSY=0, ERROR=0
